  "body": "Negotiation Range Low/Mid $1,300,000’s\r\n\r\nWalk to Macleans, huge floor area approx. 200sqm (more or less)\r\n\r\nDiscover the perfect blend of contemporary elegance and everyday comfort in this stunning free-standing residence. Designed for seamless indoor-outdoor living, this light-filled home opens effortlessly onto a generous first-floor deck—ideal for relaxing and entertaining.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n• 5 Spacious Bedrooms & 3.5 Bathrooms – Perfect for multi-generational living or hosting guests in style.\r\n• Open-Plan Living – Sun-drenched lounge and dining areas extend through large sliding doors to a private, expansive deck, creating the ultimate indoor-outdoor flow.\r\n• Designer Kitchen – Equipped with premium Miele appliances, sleek cabinetry, and ample storage for a superior culinary experience.\r\n• Self-Contained Guest Suite – A private entry leads to a downstairs bedroom with its own en-suite, offering a perfect retreat for extended family or visitors.\r\n• Double Internal-Access Garage – Secure parking plus extra storage for added convenience.\r\n• Prime Location – Zoned for top-tier schools including Macleans College and BBI, with beaches, parks, and shopping centres just moments away.\r\n\r\nNestled in one of East Auckland’s most sought-after neighbourhoods, this exceptional home offers a lifestyle of convenience and prestige. With Macleans Park and Murvale Reserve nearby, outdoor adventures are always within reach.\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity—don’t miss out! Contact us today to arrange a private viewing",
